te the onsen with small details and change the layout whenever you feel like refreshing the space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras/7869c82418bea95745eeddb0a92d0dfd.avif?t=1772143515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras_big/7869c82418bea95745eeddb0a92d0dfd.webp?t=1772143515 width=1560 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras/650e0606af7a75a5a5b8218fe0c23acc.poster.avif?t=1772143515\" width=1170 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras/650e0606af7a75a5a5b8218fe0c23acc.webm?t=1772143515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras/650e0606af7a75a5a5b8218fe0c23acc.mp4?t=1772143515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New onsens open over time, each with its own look and atmosphere. The scene changes naturally throughout the day, with weather and lighting subtly reshaping the mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras/56046c61bd06789e983c54b3959a0073.avif?t=1772143515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/extras_big/56046c61bd06789e983c54b3959a0073.webp?t=1772143515 width=1560 height=68 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808610/